window.products.push({"id":226025,"name":"SET OF 4 EVAK MINI- Best PREMIUM Airtight Storage Container for Coffee Beans, Tea and Dry Goods - EVAK - Innovation that Works by Prepara, Glass and S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RZPCwyFoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Air takes out the freshness, EVAK takes out the air! The longer your food is exposed to air, the faster it loses flavor. Glass containers with air-tight lids are readily available, but they trap stale air in with your precious food. Evacuate the air and keep your food fresher and longer with EVAK glass storage containers by Prepara. Scientifically tested. Our Evak container was tested against the leading brand of storage container and there was no comparison. The Evak locked in flavors for longer and kept contents fresher. Still not convinced?...try one- we have a 5 year guarantee for satisfaction and quality. We are sure you’ll love it. It's so simple- just push down, then pull up; no buttons or levers. Perfect for coffee, tea, cereal, dried fruits, granola, herbs, spices, confections, etc. The twin valve system automatically forces the air out as you push down the lid, and allows you to easily pull up and remove the lid to access contents. Lid acts as a plunger, hear the satisfying whoosh as the air is displaced. Designed in the USA by a very prolific team, famous for many household ‘must-have’ tools and gadgets EVAK Was funded on Kickstarter in just 2 days. Evak has since gone on to win numerous awards and accolades for its functionality and beauty. You can see Evaks in use at some very discerning restaurants and coffee roasters, including Michelin starred restaurant Daniel and at La Colombe coffee roasters…why not on your counter too! Awarded the number 1 choice ‘best storage containers to keep food fresh’ by both Good Housekeeping and Progressive Grocer. ***NOTE: Need the perfect measuring spoon to complement your Evak? we sell that too. Available in two sizes, beautifully made in stainless steel. Designed to hang tidily and always handy on the rim of the container. Just paste this into the search bar: B00UMXUNSO","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RZPCwyFoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prepara","source_asin":"B01M0XM02F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-226025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M0XM02F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M0XM02F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
