window.products.push({"id":226033,"name":"Again Products Cobblestone Corner Christmas Village Collection","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lbhPkZxlL._AC_.jpg","description":"The entire collection in one box! Step back in time with this quaint plastic and polyresin holiday village collection. This detailed set is perfect for collectors, crafters, and train enthusiasts, plus pieces are packaged for resale in gift, hobby, and holiday shops. Each case includes the entire Cobblestone Corners 2020 Christmas Village Collection, 13 units packaged for resale (27 pieces total), ranging in size from 1\" to 5\" tall. Each expertly detailed plastic building has an opening on the bottom for an LED battery-operated tealight candle (not included) so they can be easily and safely illuminated. Set includes four plastic buildings (Antique Shop, Red Steepled Church, General Store, and Classic Green Brick House), three 2-ct. packs of trees (2 Glittery White Pine Trees and 4 Snow-Capped Green Pine Trees), and five 3-ct. and one 2-ct. pack of polyresin village people and accessories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lbhPkZxlL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Again Products","source_asin":"B08LZMH8GS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-226033","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LZMH8GS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LZMH8GS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":226034,"name":"4-Piece Translucent Blue Bathroom Accessory Set | Tumbler, Toothbrush Holder, Soap Dispenser and Dish | Made with Durable Acrylic | Modern Decor | Bat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kEoJah35L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Keep your bathroom neat and organized with this translucent bathroom accessory set. Still being bothered by the toothbrushes, soaps and other common bathroom items lying around the sink or the edge of the bathtub? This beautiful and practical 4-piece bathroom accessory set provides a perfect solution for you! Each set comes with a tumbler, a toothbrush holder, a liquid/lotion dispenser, and a soap dish to help you with your organizational requirements. All items are made of quality plastic which makes them very durable and easy to clean. This bathroom accessory set comes in one single color (translucent blue) to helps you make your bathroom look more elegant and organized. Available in different vibrant opaque colors to match your bathroom color and theme. For something so beautiful and high quality you would expect to pay a high price, but this set comes at a great price! High quality and affordable. This beautiful 4 piece bathroom set will surely breathe a new life into your bathroom. Whether it's for your personal use or if you are looking for the gift for a housewarming party, this impressive looking bathroom set is one click away from adorning your bathroom walls with a pleasant appeal, functionality and immediate hassle free usage. Dimensions: Toothbrush holder: 4.02\"x3.7\"x1.49\" Toothbrush holder: 4.02\"x3.7\"x1.49\" Soap dish: 4.96\"x3.39\"x1.02\" Soap dish: 4.96\"x3.39\"x1.02\" Tumbler: 3.30\"x2.8\"x2.8\", 180ml Tumbler: 3.30\"x2.8\"x2.8\", 180ml Liquid/Lotion dispenser: 5.9\"x4.01\"x1.37\" Package Includes: Liquid/Lotion dispenser: 5.9\"x4.01\"x1.37\" Package Includes: 1 tumbler 1 tumbler 1 toothbrush holder 1 toothbrush holder 1 liquid/lotion dispenser 1 liquid/lotion dispenser 1 soap dish 1 soap dish","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kEoJah35L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JustNile","source_asin":"B00IJ4RV92","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-226034","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IJ4RV92","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IJ4RV92","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":226035,"name":"BYO by BUILT NY Rambler Neoprene Lunch Bag, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.62,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LyDQ8bq-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This BYO by Built NY Rambler Lunch Bag is a mid sized, stretchy neoprene tote, available in a variety of fun patterns, is the 'must have' among reusable insulated lunch bags. It's great for road trips, plane rides, or any time you're on the run and need to keep your food and drink cold or warm. The flat bottom keeps it upright, perfect for bottles or dishes that you don’t want tipping over. Soft grip handles make it easy to carry. It’s vinyl free, PVC free, tested for lead safety, and machine washable so there's no need to worry about spills. Stores flat, but expands to fit a variety of containers and bottles. The top zip closure keeps everything inside safe and secure.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LyDQ8bq-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BYO","source_asin":"B0126K8FDK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-226035","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0126K8FDK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0126K8FDK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
