window.products.push({"id":226147,"name":"DAILYLIFE Grove Bread Box For Kitchen Counter Dry Food Storage Container, Bread Bin, Store Bread Loaf, Dinner Rolls, Pastries, Baked Goods & More, Ret","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gzHqbakYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why use a bread box: Ever purchased or made fresh-baked bread before? If so, you know how good it is when you first bring it home, or bake it. The crust is crisp, and the inside is moist and chewy. You leave the bread on the countertop, and the next day, it’ s hard and barely edible. A bread box is the easy remedy to this. Conveniently : The bin with acrylic window, so you won’t have to lift open the lid to find out what is inside. Declutter your Countertop: This white bread box will offer a vintage touch to your kitchen. Its sleek design makes this bread box perfect for any kitchen or countertop while it takes up almost no space! This super convenient bread box is big enough to store any loaf of bread, bagels, bread rolls and buns, baguettes and more. Intuitive Swing Up Lid：This bread bins are designed with smooth gliding hardware for hassle-free use. The swing-up lid is securely attached with high quality metal hinges that allow you to open and close the box enough to keep your baked goods fresh and safe from inquisitive insects. Top Notch Quality: This large bread bin is made of power coated , with a polished finish that looks just great. Thanks to its supreme quality make sure that your new bread box will never rust, corrode or lose its shine. This powder coated box is made to last for years keeping all your baked goods fresh and tasty!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gzHqbakYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DAILYLIFE","source_asin":"B088FCBRMW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-226147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088FCBRMW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088FCBRMW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":226148,"name":"CrystalAge Unakite Generator Point","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tNBpF8wqL.jpg","description":"Unakite is believed to be a cleansing stone that drives away physical and mental toxins. It is associated with pregnancy and is sometimes used as a fertility aid. These varied powers are reflected in the range of colour and crystal the stone exhibits. Unakite contains pure quartz, green epidote and pink feldspars. This results in fresh colours that complement and lift any space. Generator points can be used during healing but are also valuable when placed in a room to release their energy steadily over time. The nurturing power of unakite makes it a wonderful addition to your home. These points are chunky, heavy duty, approx. 60-70mm in height.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tNBpF8wqL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CrystalAge","source_asin":"B007C2Y4XI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-226148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007C2Y4XI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007C2Y4XI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
