window.products.push({"id":226150,"name":"WUCHT Adult Weighted Blanket (60\"x80\", 15 lbs) for Individual Between 130-180 lbs, Navy Cotton Heavy Blanket Filled with Glass Beads","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zyw1BKi9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our company is a professional manufacturer of home textiles and has been devoted to the production of quality bedding for many years. We have been providing top quality bedding and blankets for major retailers over the years. We will create greater value for our customers based on our professional experience in producing the weighted blankets. Weighted blanket is inspired by a technique called \"Deep Touch Stimulation\" which simulates the feeling of being hugged by increasing the pressuremakes. It will help you fall asleep faster and sleep better. Please pay attention before purchasing: 1. It is recommended to choose the blanket weights 7%~12% of body weight. 2. When purchasing for children or seniors, ensure they can move the blanket off themselves if necessary. 3. Only One Weighted Inner Blanket in the package, It may also be hot for hot sleepers in warm days due to its weight, so a fan or an AC is recommended in summer. In cold days just add a WUCHT Minky Removable duvet cover which can add warmth & snug feeling. 4. If you are tall than 5’5”, you should choose queen or king size weighted blanket with the length over 80” long, or your feet may stick out the weighted blanket. 5. A weighted blanket would small than same size rerular blanket because it is supposed to cover your body other than your bed. Please be rest assured it is correct size when you see a twin/queen weighted blanket is smaller than anticipated. It is OK when a weighted blanket can’t barely cover the mattress. 6. For the first few nights, you may feel it is too heavy or too light weight. Getting used to a weighted blanket takes about 2-7 days, please bear with the magic weighted blanket a few more days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zyw1BKi9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WUCHT","source_asin":"B07G76ZR7L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-226150","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G76ZR7L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G76ZR7L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
