window.products.push({"id":226154,"name":"BUYDEEM K821 Electric Gooseneck Kettle with Variable Temperature Control, Pour Over Coffee Tea Kettle, Durable 18/8 Stainless Steel, Auto Keep Warm & ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615NYdYxOAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Precise Temperature Control - Incredibly accurate and easy to use. The LED screen allows you to customize the temperature to the degree (104-212°F temp range) and precisely hit the desired temp. Achieve the optimal temperature for all coffee, tea, pour-overs, and other recipes, whereas many electric gooseneck kettles only have a few preset temperature options. Effortless Precise Pouring - A unique electric kettle gooseneck design with perfect curvature for slow and gives you control of the flow rate. It allows you to pour the exact amount of water you need easily. Use the BUYDEEM pour-over coffee dripper set to make brewing better pour-over coffee easy. The Purest Taste - This coffee kettle is made with 100% 18/8 pro-grade stainless steel and BPA-free silicone to ensure pure taste and no flavor transfer. No Teflon and lead-free keeps the perfect taste for your coffee and tea. Comfort - Cool-touch ergonomic handle and exterior matte touch face for comfort and perfect pour spout for precise hot water pouring with no drips. Unlike most other electric tea kettles, this kettle features a quiet mode, and if you don't want this beep alert, just press \"Mude\" to turn beeps on/off. Safety First - Features British STRIX thermostat tech and NTC temperature sensor making it easy to stop boiling at the perfect moment. This safety feature turns off the kettle when water comes to a boil or when there's no water remaining. Easy Operation - The 360° swivel base and cordless kettle design is perfect for both left and right-handed users. The compact digital display built into the base and the cool touch handle make controlling your cordless kettle easier than ever.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615NYdYxOAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BUYDEEM","source_asin":"B0B7MBQXFL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-226154","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7MBQXFL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7MBQXFL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
