window.products.push({"id":226158,"name":"Buyer Star Demitasse Espresso Spoons, 8 Pieces 5.5 Inch Mini Coffee Spoon,18/10 Stainless Steel Heavy Duty Tea Spoons Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51quxi0bpfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Description: Are you still worried about preparing gifts for your friends, wife or mother etc?  Are you looking for a more durable and vivid spoon for your baby or toddler?  Colorful mini spoons set are the best choice and meet different personal demand.  Vivid colors represent a different good mood and bring a visual impact while enjoying the foods.  It makes you more unique and special than other silverware sets. Choose the color as your favorite. Specification: Brand: Buyer Star Material: Premium 18/10 Stainless steel.  Size: 8 pcs 5.5-inch teaspoons.  Each length: 5.5inch, Each weight: 1.26oz (35g) Color: Silver.  Can be used for tea, coffee, ice cream, dessert, appetizers or baby spoon.  Great for camping, hiking, travel, home and restaurant use.  Perfect Gift for Christmas, Anniversary， Housewarming， Mothers' days, Birthday etc. Heavy duty 18/10 stainless steel dessert spoon, last for years.  Dishwash safe without harsh detergen. Packaged Included: Set of 8 pieces mini teaspoons. USING INSTRUCTION: 1.Please wash the butter Knife sets with warm soapy water before first using to wash off any processing residue left from manufacturing.  2.Please use a neutral detergent to wash the silverware set after using and dry it before storage for your healthy daily use, and store in dry place.  Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions, we’ll do our best to offer help. You can ask questions to us through the “Customer questions & answers” below, and we will contact you as soon as possible. Thank you for your trust in us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51quxi0bpfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Buyer Star","source_asin":"B07Y9SKQTD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-226158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y9SKQTD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y9SKQTD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
