window.products.push({"id":226289,"name":"Now Designs Floursack Kitchen Dish Towels, Navy/Lunar/Emerald, 3 Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kmno5OUCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Take in the colors of the sky and the ocean with this set of Navy Blue, Lunar Gray and Crush Emerald Green Flour Sack Towels. Generously sized and delightfully designed, this towel is a nod to the generations of homemakers who repurposed high-quality grain and flour bags into all-purpose towels. Now Designs' Flour Sack Towels seek to echo the practicality of the cherished flour sacks of years ago while infusing a twist of bright colors and patterns for the modern kitchen. From glassware to pasta pots, these ultra-absorbent cotton flour sack kitchen towels speed up drying time. The thin, loose weave provides a lint-free finish as an ideal companion for delicate stemware and treasured dishes. The towels also dry salad greens or other fruits and veggies with ease. Their liberal size lines a large bowl or basket well, and they drape beautifully over bread dough as it rises. Keep one or two handy by the sink or stove—just like Grandma did—to handle everything from wet hands to warm pots. When you're ready to share your love of these versatile towels, they come bundled in giftable sets wrapped in baker's twine for charming presentation. Or swaddle a bouquet of fresh flowers and dress up a bottle of wine in a patterned flour sack towel as a thoughtful hostess gift. These large, multifunctional towels enhance your kitchen and beyond. The bright colors and patterns add vibrancy to your counters and bring extra style to your tabletop as a place mat or folded as a trivet. A simple machine wash and dry refreshes your towels, and you can count on them not to shrink as you revel in the softness that grows with every spin through the laundry. The beauty and practicality of these Now Designs flour sack towels is sure to win over culinary masters and kitchen novices alike.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kmno5OUCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Now Designs","source_asin":"B08M8SJK67","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-226289","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M8SJK67","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M8SJK67","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
