window.products.push({"id":226478,"name":"UMAY Twin Air Mattress with Built in Pump Raised, One-Button Self Inflating Waterproof Blow Up Mattress for Camping Without Power Supply(Dark)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6140IYmj+4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🛏️【Rechargeable Pump Design Without Power Supply】UMAY air mattress has a detachable built in pump that inflates the aerobed without power supply. Once charged with USB charger, the built in pump stores for electricity and it will take 4 hours to be fully charged. Later, it can inflate or deflate the mattress without the need for a power cord, which can be used about 3-5 times. 🛏️【One Button Quick Hassle-Free Self-Inflation&Deflation】After simply pushing a button, our air mattress with built in pump can achieve full comfort and firmness in 3-4 mins, whose size is 75.2*39.0*17.7 inches and bearing capacity is 330 lbs, eliminating the hassle of manually inflating the air bed. With three different nozzles assisting the operation and instructions manuals guiding the use, you just need to flick the switch to make the air mattress automatically deflate within 3 minutes. 🛏️【Superior Construction and Fabrics】The blow up mattress features a coil beam construction with 40 internal air coils, providing elastic support to fit the curvature of the body for a deep sleep. Made from 3-layer PVC with 0.4 mm thickness for the side and bottom, the air mattress is designed with double-sealed valves and precision seams, durable enough to prevent air leakage. A skin-friendly, soft and hard-wearing flocked top with 0.6 mm thickness is waterproof to make it easy to clean. 🛏️【Easy to Store and Carry】Our inflatable bed with built in pump comes with three gas nozzles, a charging cable, a carrying bag, repair patches and a user manual. Equipped with a storage bag, the portable bed can be folded into the size of a gym bag weighing 12.12 pounds that can be put in closet or car trunk. The convenient carring bag allows you to take it anywhere, suitable for home(bedroom, living room for guests), easy transportation, outdoor(tent, beach). 🛏️【Custom Comfort】Customize the amount of air in your temporary bed to fit your sleep. Simply press the inflation/deflation valve to help you maximize your comfort by adding or subtracting air. Transform restless nights into soothing sleep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6140IYmj+4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UMAY","source_asin":"B0BTT37QHZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-226478","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTT37QHZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTT37QHZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
