window.products.push({"id":226500,"name":"Riveira Tongs for Cooking with Silicone Tips | 9 and 12-Inch Pieces Set | Non-Stick Kitchen Grill Tongs | BBQ Grilling Tong | 550°F High Heat-Resistan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uHV5iG-2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<p>EVERYDAY HANDLING VERSATILITY- Make cooking, grilling, and handling food easier with these premium kitchen tongs. Designed for peerless maneuvering and precise grasping, this set of tongs for cooking with silicone tips offers sturdy, reliable picking and grabbing of hot foods from your grill or stove while protecting your hands from hot cooking temperatures so you can prepare foods without compromising your safety. Easy usage makes this duo perfect for everyday meal prepping.</p> <p>SPECIALLY DESIGNED FOR UTILITY- Innovative formulation delivers grill tongs that are ideal for handling all sorts of food. Lightweight ergonomically designed silicone tongs feature scalloped edges for seamless lifting of chicken, meats, veggies, fruit pieces, and more. Locking mechanism keeps bbq tongs slim, secure for easy storage in drawers or utensil holders when not in use. Practical looped ends make them easy to hang in your kitchen so you can keep them readily accessible.</p> <p>ENGINEERED WITH PREMIUM MATERIAL- Crafted of high-quality 304 stainless steel, making these metal tongs durable and resistant to corrosion and rust. Paired with non-stick, heat-resistant silicone tips to protect pots or pans from scratches while also providing unrivaled safety from high grill and stove temperatures. Premier material is dishwasher safe so you can pop these handy stainless steel tongs in your washer for easy clean-up after use to make your life easier.</p> <p>COMPLETE FUNCTIONALITY- Individual cooking tong 9 in and 12” size long tongs offer 2 practical tools for handling all food types. 12” thongs kitchen provide superior gripping power for picking and lifting hefty chicken breasts, steaks, and more. Small tongs 9” rubber tongs deliver precise handling of smaller food portions, fruit chunks, small burgers, and more. Duo of kitchen tongs make sure you’re always prepared for any cooking, grilling, or food prepping.</p> <p>LIMITED LIFETIME WARRANTY- Unlike most common brands on the market, we pride ourselves on 100% customer satisfaction, which is why we offer a lifetime warranty on our stainless steel tongs. We’re so confident in the superiority and performance of our products that if you’re not happy with your purchase, simply send it back for a full refund.</p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uHV5iG-2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Riveira","source_asin":"B0C24ZZZC7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-226500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C24ZZZC7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C24ZZZC7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":226501,"name":"Tirrinia 6 Bottle Wine Cooler Bag - Insulated Padded Portable Versatile Wine Gift carrier Tote Bag for Travel, BYOB Restaurant, Wine Tasting, Party, P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Zu2kBEiRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tirrinia Insulated wine cooler bag is lightweight, durable, and compact insulated food, wine container has a dual zip-around closure. It is made elaborately of durable 600D Polyester, insulated with the material which easy to clean and keep temperature cool for hours.  The back pocket storing tools, napkin, snake, etc. Thermal insulated compartment can hold 6 bottles of normal size red wine. The thick padding detachable divider prevents wine bottles from clinking or shattering, take it out, and instantly turn it to a large picnic bag. Easy-grip handle & adjustable shoulder strap made it easy to carry. wine gift carrier bag is a great bag for taking your wine, food, and beverages to work, school, picnic, and field trips while keeping them cold for hours. Package Content: 1x 6 Bottles wine gift bag","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Zu2kBEiRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tirrinia","source_asin":"B08HH9J5GL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-226501","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HH9J5GL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HH9J5GL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
