window.products.push({"id":226725,"name":"Topeakmart Lift Top Coffee Table with Hidden Compartment and 2 Fabric Storage Baskets, Center Table with Lift Tabletop Raisable Top Coffee Table for L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818NLP-XSwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lift Top Coffee Table with Hidden Compartment, 2 Storage Baskets and Partitioned Open Shelves, Rustic Wood Center Table with Raisable Top for Living Room, Home, OfficeQuick Overview:Tired of seeing your apartment scattered with a tangle of stuff? You need a coffee table with storage to organize. The lif-top design equipped with a gas spring lifting mechanism allows you to use the table in multiple ways, converting it to a desk for writing, dining or working on your laptop while sitting comfortably on the sofa without leaning forward. Made of waterproof veneered MDF board and solid metal structure, this low-key yet stylish lift-top coffee table can effortlessly blend into any style and décor, adding a touch of minimalist appeal and timeless elegance to your room. Under the tabletop hides a spacious storage compartment for keeping your daily essentials like remotes, snacks, chargers and suchlike with ease of access.Specifications:Color: GrayMaterial: steel, MDFOverall Dimension (with tabletop down): 47.5 x 24 x 20’’ (L x W x H)Extended Dimension (with tabletop up): 47.5 x 24 x 25.5’’ (L x W x H)Hidden Compartment Inner Size: 42.5 x 20.5 x 4’’ (L x W x D)Fabric Storage Basket Inner Size (each): 19.5 x 19.5 x 8’’ (L x W x D)Ground Clearance: 12.5cm / 5’’Max. Weight Capacity: tabletop (up): 66lb; tabletop (down): 199lb; hidden storage: 44lb; fabric storage basket (each): 22lbN.W.: 61.7lbG.W.: 66.6lbNote:1. Please allow ±0.5” errors due to manual measurements.2. For your safety, please do not stand on the tabletop.3. Please be careful with your fingers when lifting/lowering the tabletop.Package included:1 x Lift-top Coffee Table2 x Fabric Storage Baskets1 x Instructions","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818NLP-XSwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Topeakmart","source_asin":"B09QSX42Y8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-226725","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QSX42Y8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QSX42Y8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
