window.products.push({"id":226860,"name":"JASIWAY Over Sink Dish Drying Rack, Adjustable 2 Tier Stainless Steel Large Kitchen Dish Drainer(27.5\"-33.5\"), Expandable Counter Organizer Storage Sp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+BTpMaDUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍Upgarded Sturdy & Stable: The structure of dish rack over sink has been improved to add its stability. It can hold 132lbs, doesn't shake or fall forward. The L-shaped bracket structure is more scientific and the force is more uniform. Non-slip adjustable suction cups suck the countertop tightly, increasing stability. Our 2 tier dish drying rack over the sink do not block your hands, meet your head, block the line of sight, improve the efficiency of daily cleaning. 👍100% Stainless Steel: Our expandable dish drying rack over sink is made of thick & durable stainless steel. 3 layers of Nano-coating for care, say goodbye to rust, with carbon steel and black-gray piano paint protection layer, sturdy and durable. Two tier dish drying rack stainless steel with this well-made baking varnish process can achieve no paint falling, no fading, and corrosion resistance. 👍Large Sink Dish Drying Rack: Are you still troubled by the mess and limited space in the kitchen? With our extra large dish drying rack, you can put pots & pans, food processors, storage jars go on top. The lower rack saves bowls, plates and cups. Widened dish slot, suitable for large or small dishes, breaking the storage limit. The design of our dish drainer over sink is breathable and draining, which can dry quickly, keep it clean and tidy. 👍Fit 99% Kitchen Sink: Our retractable kitchen dish drying rack suitable for most sinks (single and double sinks). No longer worry about buying the wrong size, the length can be adjusted freely. This over the sink dish rack measures 27.5\" -33.5\"(L) * 12.09\"(W) * 31.5\"(H). NOTE: Make sure you measure the size of sink, the length of the faucet and the height between the cabinet bottom to the countertop before you order. 👍Free Up Space & Easy to Install: Over sink dish rack stainless steel is maximize space in your kitchen with 2 shelves, 1 utensil holder, 1 knife holder, 1 cutting board holder, 1 basket and 6 hooks. You just need to install it with attached hexagonal wrench and it will take you few minutes. This metal dish drying rack large has careful design and strict quality inspection, so you can use it with confidence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+BTpMaDUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JASIWAY","source_asin":"B086QRRK1V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-226860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086QRRK1V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086QRRK1V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
