window.products.push({"id":226947,"name":"JETKONG Serving Tweezer Tongs 9-Inch Cooking Tweezers Kitchen Tweezers, Set of 3 (9 9 9 Inch, Silver)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6173w2vfP-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Perfect Tweezer Style Tongs for Various Goodies】- Each package includes 3 pieces 9-inch (23.3cm) tweezer tongs (Silver) , these kitchen tweezers are widely used, they're not just for serving appetizers, meat, steak, bread, salad, cookies, fried, hot dog, spaghetti, buffet, bbq, baking and so on. Even can be used for feeding small animals, cleaning out a garden or fish tank, plant maintenance. ✅【Premuim Material, Easy on Your Hand】- Our cooking tweezer are made of high quality 100% food grade stainless steel, rust -proof, anti-corrosive, sturdy, durable and built to last. Precision sawtooth is enough to be reliable to touch and even press, which is prevent food to drop, easy to grip and clamp fine. While remaining lightweight and avoid to slipping and sliding. ✅【Multifunctional Use】- Great for serving appetizers, desserts, salads, burgers, hot dogs, toppings and more for any party, family dinners and any other event. ✅【Ergonomic Design】- These tweezers design with comfortable ergonomic shape, precision tweezer food tongs to protect your movements. The tip of the cooking tweezers is slender and easy to hold and extend into a narrow space. The hook design at the rear makes it easy to store and hang in any corner of the kitchen. ✅【100% Satisfaction Service】- We have been committed to provide customer with the high quality product and offer a 100% SATISFACTION SERVICE for your stainless steel tweezer tongs. If you have any questions, just contact us through your order. We will provide you with a 100% satisfaction solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6173w2vfP-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JETKONG","source_asin":"B0BBPRLH73","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-226947","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBPRLH73","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBPRLH73","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":226948,"name":"Yankee Candle Gold Perfect Wick Trimmer Candle Tool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31xONDSEViL._AC_.jpg","description":"Caring for your Candles To enjoy your candles to their fullest, a certain amount of care is required. Keeping their wicks trimmed properly will help your candles burn fully and last longer. Specifically, your candle's wick should be trimmed after every 4 hours of burn time. Let the candle come to room temperature, then trim the wick to 1/8-inch before relighting. That length helps create complete combustion, which means less soot is formed while the candle is burning. This is where our Perfect Wick Trimmer comes in - place the bottom of the trimmer flush with the candle surface, rock the trimmer back so that its \"elbow\" rests on the surface, this keeps the trimmer at a 45-degree angle and helps ensure the cut is to the proper length. Simple! Enjoy your candles and their fragrances, then repeat again after every 4 hours of burn time. About The Perfect Wick Trimmer The proper tool makes every task easy. This is the essential one for maintaining your candle's wick properly. Our heavy-duty metal wick trimmer clips wicks to 1/8\" to ensure a clean, even flame for a longer lasting candle and maximum fragrance. (To learn why this is important, see Caring for your Candles at left.) Long enough to reach the bottom of our Large Jar Candles, the Perfect Wick Trimmer's design also easily lets you remove the clipped wick safely. You can't do that with a pair of scissors! Dimensions 1.375\" x 2.375\" x 7.625\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31xONDSEViL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yankee Candle","source_asin":"B01LY92QVI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-226948","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LY92QVI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LY92QVI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
